{"title":"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_17\">Problem 17</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 17\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/3/5c3bdc83cc6f4930136a978a0f7e60dc19210101.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=a+\\frac{b}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"78\" height=\"37\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are constants, and if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c3b4834614e5e7e189cb7d621cfb4fb0bd36dd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/c/86c2e8c17cff668023b2f29f2e95e4a0fafa6271.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/d/ecd049e624a41c0df950b22dadf2257ee2ad9410.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/2/c82313374f44e5d6d2b748519cb6fd317c9a303c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-5$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add2609af1bb7632cc22b68fd49fdd94de06b327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> equals:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/6/5a685774d749f5d2058508cd384707fae4d29d84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -1 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 0\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 1\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 10\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"388\" height=\"17\" />   \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in the x and y values, we obtain the following system of equations:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/4/8f4f5cc41adcd1f1426c7e6ab0a72f080daca3e8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin {cases} 1 = a - b \\\\ 5 = a - \\frac{b}{5} \\end {cases}\\]\" width=\"86\" height=\"53\" />\nWe can then subtract the equations to obtain the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/3/303a54ee93f3972242af7377dbe2c6e7caa599e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 = 0.8b$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"64\" height=\"13\" />, which works out to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add0bf97955f4eedafea7db58ac66eb4a130baa2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Plugging that in to the original system of equations:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/8/3f862d7076751b4aa495518341b913dfa099421e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin {cases} 1 = a - 5 \\\\ 5 = a - \\frac{5}{5} \\end {cases}\\]\" width=\"86\" height=\"53\" />\nIt is easy to see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/c/eac964e50ab7e4904f600a0a12e157a994617fe4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, and that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add2609af1bb7632cc22b68fd49fdd94de06b327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/b/18bd2661408f1198333bf23d7ee9dc44644ed40c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) } 11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"65\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME\" title=\"1959 AHSME\">1959 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1959 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1959\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Prob